 released online by the Reserve Bank of India (RBI) before the examination.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"290\"\u003eHow can I download the RBI Officer Grade-B Admit Card 2026?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e Candidates can download the admit card from the official RBI recruitment portal by logging in with their registration credentials.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e \u003cstrong data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"491\"\u003eWhat details are required to download the admit card?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e Candidates need their Registration Number/Roll Number and Password or Date of Birth.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"652\"\u003eIs it mandatory to carry the admit card to the exam center?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer: \u003c/strong\u003eYes, candidates must carry a printed copy of the admit card to the examination center.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e What is the official website for \u003cb\u003eRBI\u003c/b\u003e?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The official website for \u003cb\u003eRBI \u003c/b\u003eis \u003cstrong\u003ehttps://www.rbi.org.in/\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-36156 aligncenter\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-26-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"RBI Officer Grade-B Admit Card 2026\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-26-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-26-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkar